WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:05.709
When something needs attention, click the
Scry Sync icon in the menu bar.

2
00:00:06.279 --> 00:00:09.759
The status line says how many files need
attention.

3
00:00:10.329 --> 00:00:13.384
Each row names the file and the fix.

4
00:00:13.954 --> 00:00:18.203
Choose Show in folder to jump to the file
in Finder.

5
00:00:18.773 --> 00:00:22.194
Fix it there, and the next sync picks it
up.
